 "notes": "这一版修复了宠物散步时被滚动打断的问题。\n\n- **滚动不再打断散步。** 宠物散步时，你滚动页面不会让它停下，和网页版的行为一致；打字和点击仍会让它停下。\n\n---\n\nThis release fixes a stroll being interrupted by scrolling.\n\n- **Scrolling no longer ends a stroll.** The pet keeps walking while you scroll a page, as the web version already does. Typing and clicking still stop it.\n\n---\n\nUnofficial fan project, not affiliated with Anthropic. Builds are not notarized or code-signed by a trusted authority.\n非官方同人作品，与 Anthropic 无关。安装包未经官方签名，首次打开的步骤见[下载页](https://jokbet.jokerben.top/download#install)。\n\nSee the [download page](https://jokbet.jokerben.top/download#install) for install steps.",
